# Heir of Wisdom — environment variables
#
# Every variable the app reads is listed here. Each is marked `required` or
# `optional` with what breaks without it. Copy to `.env.local` for local use;
# `.env.local` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Rule: no secret is ever prefixed `NEXT_PUBLIC_`. Anything with that prefix is
# shipped to the browser. Server-only values stay server-only.
#
# Status at launch (plan Open Questions): auth provider, database/backend and
# AI provider are undecided. Until they are, the app runs in demo mode against a
# local file-backed store, and every variable below is optional.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data source
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# optional — unset selects the demo file-backed store.
# Set to `demo` to force demo mode regardless of other configuration.
DATA_SOURCE=demo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Demo mode
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# optional — no default. Path to the local file the demo store writes to.
# Defaults to `.data/demo.json`. Only read when DATA_SOURCE=demo.
DEMO_DATA_FILE=.data/demo.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auth (added by U6, once a provider is chosen)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# optional — absent, the app runs DemoAuthProvider. Nothing reads a credential
# today; these placeholders reserve the shape so U6 does not invent one.
# AUTH_PROVIDER=
# AUTH_SECRET=